    "Targeted and content runs precede source commit creation; tested file identities, actual HEAD/index chronology and skipped first content attempt are retained rather than relabeled.",
    "No target repository edits,index/ref writes,remote writes,paid model calls or device actions were performed by this reviewer. Scratch reports and isolated local probes only."
  ],
